Given:

x + y + z = 0

Concept used:

If (a + b + c) = 0 then a³ + b³ + c³ = 3abc

Calculation:

According to the concept,

frac {x} {(yz)²}+ frac {y} {(xz)²} + frac {z} {(xy)²}

⇒ frac {(xtimes x²) + (ytimes y²) + (ztimes z²)}{(xyz)²}

⇒ frac {x³ + y³ + z³}{(xyz)²}

⇒ frac {3xyz}{(xyz)²} (∵ x + y + z = 0, so x³ + y³ + z³ = 3xyz)

⇒ frac {3} {xyz}

**∴ The value of frac {x} {(yz)²}+ frac {y} {(xz)²} + frac {z} {(xy)²} is frac {3} {xyz}.**
